    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir51">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e98">Caput 51</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_1@1-4">Oratio Jesu filii Sirach.</quote>
            Melius ad totam Ecclesiam refertur, quam ad unam personam, quia in ea multae species tribulationum et diversa solatia describuntur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e110">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e112" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_1@5-8">Confitebor tibi, Domine rex.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir51-Rd1e115"><name xml:id="gom-sir51-Nd1e116" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e119">JesusChristus adjutor et protector est sponsae suae, qui tradidit semetipsum pro ea, ut liberaret eam a perditione originalis peccati.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e125">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_5@8-9">Portis tribulationum.</quote>
            Haec sunt ora principum et tyrannorum, unde minae prodeunt et fraudulentiae, quae servos Dei negare fidem compellunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e134">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e136">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e138">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1230D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_6@1-3">A pressura flammae.</quote>
            Hoc tribus pueris contigit in camino ignis corporaliter; sed omnes sancti ab aestu persecutionis liberantur spiritualiter.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e147">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e149">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_9@1-6">Et vita mea appropinquans erat inferno.</quote>
            Quia vita carnis quotidie deficiendo ad mortem tendit. Mortem enim <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e156" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_7@4-4">infernum</quote> vocat, quia mors carnis, primi peccati vindicta est, sicut infernus peccantium animarum poena perpetua.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e162">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e164">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e166">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e168" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_10@1-3">Circumdederunt me undique,</quote>
            etc. Videns Ecclesia se ab hostibus circumdari, et humanum deesse solatium, a Deo quaerit adjutorium, a quo est omne bonum, cui attribuit quod liberatur ab inimicis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e173">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e175">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e177">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1231A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e181" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_18@1-3">Cum adhuc junior essem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir51-Rd1e184"><name xml:id="gom-sir51-Nd1e185" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e188"><seg type="qs">In juventute, vel pueritia</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quomodo ab infantia quaesierit sapientiam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_18@5-6">Priusquam oberrarem,</quote>
            etc. Signat se ante errorem pueritiae vel juventutis desiderasse sapientiam, et a Domino postulasse, et usque ad novissimum perseverasse.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e203">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e205">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e207">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e209" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_19@13-15">Tanquam praecox uva.</quote>
            Decorem sapientiae comparat praecoquae uvae, ut ostendat jucunditatem apud eam esse. Praecoqua enim uva dicitur eo quod cito maturescat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e214">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e216">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_24@1-2">Consiliatus sum,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir51-Rd1e223"><name xml:id="gom-sir51-Nd1e224" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e227"><seg type="qs">Prius dicit se consilium inisse ut faceret illam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sic enim confirmatus, perveniet ad fructum sapientiae.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e236">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e238">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e240">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e242" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_29@1-2">Venter meus.</quote>
            Commotus ad poenitentiam per sapientiae notitiam.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e246">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e248" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_29@7-7">Propterea.</quote>
            Ad perfectionem sapientiae pervenire non est humani studii, sed divini muneris.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e253">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e255">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e257">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e259" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_30@1-4">Dedit mihi Dominus,</quote>
            etc. Bona merces est lingua erudita, quae fecit fratres instruere et corrigere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir51-Dd1e265">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir51-Hd1e267">Versus 37</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir51-d1e269">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir51-Qd1e271" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir51_37@1-2">Laetetur anima.</quote>
            Magna est jucunditas cordis, si recordatur misericordiam superni judicis.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
